### 替换文档内容
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/5/content
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="updated.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./updated.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 强制重建索引
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/5/reindex-force

### 8. 查询任务状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/5/status
Authorization: Bearer <token>